g=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Finsta360-x5-8k-360-action-camera-black%2FJ39VLT4C63, https://rei.pxf.io/c/482924/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC00518%2Finsta360-x5]\n[Product: Peak Design Everyday Sling Bag (3L) | https://rei.pxf.io/c/482924/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2F243292%2Fpeak-design-everyday-sling-bag]\n[Product: Keychron K2 HE keyboard | https://www.amazon.com/Keychron-Mechanical-Double-Rail-Bluetooth-Compatible/dp/B0DCVQBMVP?ref_=ast_sto_dp&tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FKeychron-K2-HE-Rapid-Trigger-Wireless-Custom-Mechanical-Keyboard-Hall-Effect-Gateron-Double-Rail-Magnetic-Switch-QMK-2-4-GHz-Bluetooth-5-2-RGB-Compat%2F16532107543, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.keychron.com%2Fproducts%2Fkeychron-k2-he-wireless-magnetic-switch-keyboard%3Fvariant%3D41846757883993]\n[Product: Govee Uplighter Floor Lamp | https://www.amazon.com/Govee-Uplighter-Projector-Bedroom-Standing/dp/B0F3NZ12GL?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FGovee-Uplighter-Floor-Lamp%2F17115018059%2F, https://govee.sjv.io/c/482924/3014037/12845?u=https%3A%2F%2Fus.govee.com%2Fproducts%2Fgovee-uplighter-floor-lamp]\n[Product: Kobo Libra Colour | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fkobo-libra-colour--ereader--7-glare-free-colour-e-ink-kaleido-3-display--dark-mode-option--waterproof-2024-white%2FJXSHPC3Q96, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.kobobooks.com%2Fproducts%2Fkobo-libra-colour, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fkobo-libra-colour-7-32gb-ereader-glare-free-colour-e-ink-kaleido-3-display-dark-mode-option-audiobooks-waterproof%2F-%2FA-91830243]\n[Product: S