ruction)\n/Dest [22 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 10: Earnings growth converging between the Mag 7 and the S&P 493)\n/Dest [35 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 23: Different interest rate sensitivity for office and data centers)\n/Dest [23 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 11: Hyperscaler capex as a share of operating cash flow)\n/Dest [34 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 22: Different interest rate sensitivity for office construction and datacenter construction)\n/Dest [24 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 12: Performance of S&P 500 versus S&P 500 excluding AI enablers)\n/Dest [33 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 21: Monthly corporate AI spend per employee, top vs. median spenders)\n/Dest [25 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 13: Semiconductors account for 19% of the S&P 500)\n/Dest [32 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 20: Monthly token usage by AI models)\n/Dest [26 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 14: Mag 7 forward P/E ratio versus S&P 493 P/E ratio)\n/Dest [31 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 19: Comparing token costs across large language models)\n/Dest [27 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 15: Mag 7 P/E premium at the lowest level in more than a decade)\n/Dest [30 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 18: Token costs, token usage, and datacenter construction)\n/Dest [28 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 16: Mag 7 market cap compared with the market cap of stock markets in Japan, Canda, and UK)\n/Dest [29 0 R /XYZ 0 540 0]\n/Title (Slide 17: Comparing the NVIDIA market cap with the market cap of selected stock markets)",
