      "id": "theverge-2026-06-27-24-prime-day-deals-verge-readers-are-grabbing-before-prime-d",
      "title": "24 Prime Day deals Verge readers are grabbing before Prime Day ends",
      "summary": "The tiny Xteink X4 reader is proving surprisingly popular.\t\n\nThere are an overwhelming number of Prime Day deals to sort through, which is why we spend so much time highlighting products we’ve already tested and can stand behind. But our recommendations are only one way to identify a worthwhile deal: another is seeing which products fellow Verge readers actually buy.\nBelow, we’ve rounded up the de",
      "body": "There are an overwhelming number of Prime Day deals to sort through, which is why we spend so much time highlighting products we’ve already tested and can stand behind. But our recommendations are only one way to identify a worthwhile deal: another is seeing which products fellow Verge readers actually buy.\nBelow, we’ve rounded up the deals that have resonated most with readers who spend as much time thinking about tech as we do. It’s a great way to see what people actually think is a great deal —&nbsp;and what products everyone has been waiting for a price drop on.\nSome of the favorites are exactly what you’d expect, like AirPods and Kindles. Others, like Birdbuddy’s camera-equipped smart bird feeder, were a more surprising. If you’re looking for some shopping inspiration, or are simply curious what your fellow readers have been adding to their carts, here are the products that have proven most popular so far during Prime Day.\n[Product: Hoto 3.6V Electric Screwdriver Kit Pro | https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0BLMQ8BXB/ref=ewc_pr_img_1?smid=A2ZXT6R0FR7K6V&psc=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FHOTO-Electric-Screwdriver-Kit-25-Piece-Upgraded-Bit-Set-3-6V-Cordless-Screwdriver-Rechargeable%2F14102211010]\n[Product: Birdbuddy Pro (solar) | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DHY6B9GY?tag=theverge02-20, https://mybirdbuddy.com/product/smart-bird-feeder-pro-solar-v2/]\n[Product: Xteink X4 e-reader | https://www.amazon.com/XTEINK-Developer-Ultra-Thin-Magnetic-Ready-Distraction-Free/dp/B0GR4BCJK3/ref=sr_1_2_sspa?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: SwitchBot Smart Switch Button Pusher | https://www.amazon.com/SwitchBot-Series/dp/B07B4D9KVX/?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.switch-bot.com%2Fproducts%2Fswitchbot-bot%2F]\n[Product: Dyson PencilWash | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GKJ1PYJZ/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: AirPods Pro 3 | https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FAirPods-nbsp-Pro-nbsp-3%2F17835006350, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-airpods-pro-3-wireless-active-noise-cancelling-earbuds-with-heart-rate-sensing-feature-white%2FJJGCQLYK5F]\n[Product: Apple Watch SE 3 | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FQFW7M9H?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Aqara Smart Lock U400 | https://www.amazon.com/Aqara-Fingerprint-Touchscreen-Rechargeable-Assistant/dp/B0FRS6T6HL/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Kindle Paperwhite (12th-gen) | http://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CFPJYX7P?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DDZJS3SB?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Amazon Kindle Colorsoft Essentials Bundle | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DB6CRYXC?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Belkin Charging Case for Nintendo Switch 2 | https://www.amazon.com/Belkin-Nintendo-Integrated-Protective-Cartridges/dp/B0FBQCJGL7/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fbelkin-gaming-charging-case-for-nintendo-switch-2-10k-portable-charger-case-20w-quick-charging-game-card-storage-charcoal%2FJX532949CX%2Fsku%2F6638599]\n[Product: Fitbit Ace LTE | https://www.amazon.com/Fitbit-Google-Ace-LTE-Activity-Based/dp/B0CV5T2YG6?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Ffitbit-ace-lte-kids-smartwatch-with-in-app-calling-messaging-gps-mild-2024%2FJ39TC87JYC]\n[Product: Apple AirTags (second-generation) | https://www.amazon.com/Apple-AirTag-2nd-Generation-Precision/dp/B0GJTXVN9Z?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fapple-airtag-4-pack-2nd-generation-2026-white%2FJJGCQLTTF3]\n[Product: Glocusent Book Light | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WNRN9WQ/?tag=theverge02-20, https://glocusent.com/collections/glocusent-top-sellers/products/glocusent-neck-reading-light-blue]\n[Product: Belkin BoostCharge Pro 3-in-1 Wireless Charging Stand with Qi2 15W | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DL86NC5Z/?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DL8CK73P/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Anker Laptop Power Bank | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DCBB2YTR/?tag=theverge02-20, https://anker.pxf.io/c/482924/1543964/18023?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fproducts%2Fa1695-anker-power-bank-25000mah-165w]\n[Product: Google Nest Wifi Pro | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCQTXR25?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCQSYPZB?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Google TV Streamer (4K) | https://www.amazon.com/Google-TV-Streamer-Streaming-Entertainment/dp/B0D8WJYSF9/?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.anrdoezrs.net/links/8836598/type/dlg/https://store.google.com/config/google_tv_streamer?hl=en-US, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fgoogle-tv-streamer-4k-fast-streaming-device-in-4k-hdr-32-gb-of-storage-hazel%2FJ3GT5ZSHC5%2Fsku%2F6642280]\n[Product: Lego Star Wars Imperial Star Destroyer | https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Destroyer-Buildable-Anniversary-Minifigure/dp/B0CRWRY5RM?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FLEGO-Star-Wars-Imperial-Destroyer-Buildable-Starship-Set-Toy-Kids-Darth-Vader-25th-Anniversary-Minifigure-Cal-Kestis-Gift-Boys-Girls-Fans-75394%2F10922117317, https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=nOD/rLJHOac&mid=13923&murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fproduct%2Fimperial-star-destroyer-75394]\n[Product: SwitchBot Standing Circulator Fan | https://www.amazon.com/SwitchBot-Pedestal-Rechargeable-Oscillating-Adjustable/dp/B0FWC41M2P/ref=sr_1_2?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.switch-bot.com%2Fproducts%2Fswitchbot-standing-circulator-fan]\n[Product: Metal Gear Solid Delta: Snake Eater | https://www.amazon.com/METAL-GEAR-SOLID-TACTICAL-PlayStation-5/dp/B0D4RJGFDT?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FMetal-Gear-Solid-Snake-Eater-Tactical-Edition-Xbox-Series-X%2F6379773183, https://www.amazon.com/METAL-GEAR-SOLID-TACTICAL-PlayStation-5/dp/B0D4SDQCG3?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Niimbot D110 Label Printer with Tape | https://www.amazon.com/NIIMBOT-Upgraded-Bluetooth-Templates-Organization/dp/B0CZ6WCHGF/?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FNIIMBOT-Label-Maker-D110-Upgraded-Mini-Portable-Label-Printer-Inkless-Labeler-Sticker-Bluetooth-Rechargeable-Thermal-Label-Maker-Machine-Tape-White-E%2F5669222918, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fniimbots.com%2Fproducts%2Fd110-portable-wireless-connect-rechargeable-mini-label-printer-with-tape]\n[Product: Vampliers 5-inch Mini Stripped Screw Remover Pliers | https://www.amazon.com/VAMPLIERS-Stripped-Removal-Pliers-Electronic/dp/B00LMMU2HG?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Nex Playground | https://www.amazon.com/Playground-AI-Powered-Transforms-Not-Machine-Specific/dp/B0D2JGYX3F?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FNex-Playground-Game-System%2F9402952208, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fplayground-the-active-play-system-for-kids-families-indoor-physical-play-meets-interactive-family-fun%2FJ3Q5RY2VVT]\nUpdate, June 26th: Updated prices and availability and added a few new deals, including a discount for the Xteink X40 e-reader.",
