      "id": "theverge-2026-06-26-our-favorite-prime-day-gadgets-under-100-you-don-8217-t-need",
      "title": "Our favorite Prime Day gadgets under $100 you don&#8217;t need but will really want",
      "summary": "Govee’s floor lamps are just $60. | Image: Govee:\t\n\nPrime Day has a funny way of convincing you to buy things you weren’t shopping for in the first place. You sign on intending to buy something sensible you actually need, like a pack of USB-C cables, and an hour later you’ve also added a gadget that can press your coffee maker’s power button and a color-changing smart lamp that syncs to music to y",
      "body": "Prime Day has a funny way of convincing you to buy things you weren’t shopping for in the first place. You sign on intending to buy something sensible you actually need, like a pack of USB-C cables, and an hour later you’ve also added a gadget that can press your coffee maker’s power button and a color-changing smart lamp that syncs to music to your cart.&nbsp;\nThey aren’t exactly essentials, but they’re the kind of gadgets you never knew you wanted until you saw them and often end up being the most delightful to own. From a pocket-size gaming controller and a tiny crafting machine that lets you make stickers and cards to a cordless barcode scanner that lets you catalog your home library like a real librarian, these are the Verge-approved small gadgets you probably don’t need but will totally want anyway, most of which cost less than $100.\n[Product: SwitchBot Smart Switch Button Pusher | https://www.amazon.com/SwitchBot-Series/dp/B07B4D9KVX/?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.switch-bot.com%2Fproducts%2Fswitchbot-bot%2F]\n[Product: VidaBay Snap E Ink fridge magnet | https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0GT43RVSY/?tag=theverge02-20, https://vidabay.net/product/white-e-paper-fridge-sticker/, https://vidabay.net/product/white-e-paper-fridge-sticker-2/]\n[Product: Philips Hue smart bulb starter kit | https://www.amazon.com/Philips-Hue-Starter-Compatible-Assistant/dp/B096YFWVVS/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Ugreen FineTrack 2 Bluetooth tracker | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0G64RT15Y/?tag=theverge02-20, https://us.ugreen.com/products/soccer-ball-bluetooth-tracker]\n[Product: JisuLife Handheld Fan Life8 | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QK9C9KT/?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FJISULIFE-Handheld-Mini-Fan-3-1-Hand-USB-Rechargeable-Small-Pocket-Fan-12-19-Working-Hours-Power-Bank-Flashlight-Portable-Travel-Summer-Concerts-Lash%2F520140216%2F, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fjisulife.com%2Fproducts%2Fjisulife-f8-handheld-mini-fan%2F]\n[Product: GamesSir Pocket Taco mobile controller | https://www.amazon.com/GameSir-Pocket-Vertical-Mobile-Controller-Smartphone/dp/B0GJSWSMFN/?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FGameSir-Pocket-Taco-Bluetooth-Mobile-Gaming-Controller-Perfect-for-Retro-Scene%2F19936969587%2F, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fgamesir-pocket-taco-bluetooth-wireless-retro-mobile-gaming-controller-for-ios-android-turn-your-smartphone-into-a-gameboy-white%2FJ3R85HZQPQ%2Fsku%2F6674072]\n[Product: Govee Table Lamp 2 | https://www.amazon.com/Govee-Bedside-Changing-Bedroom-Dimmable/dp/B0D41XL87F?tag=theverge02-20, https://govee.sjv.io/c/482924/3014037/12845?u=https%3A%2F%2Fus.govee.com%2Fproducts%2Fled-table-lamp-2]\n[Product: Keychron V1 Max | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CR14LGX6/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fkeychron-v1-max-75-custom-wireless-rgb-mechanical-keyboard-with-programmable-qmk-via-hot-swappable-red-switch-black%2FCGC7F9CCVV%2Fsku%2F6600175]\n[Product: Glocusent Book Light | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WNRN9WQ/?tag=theverge02-20, https://glocusent.com/collections/glocusent-top-sellers/products/glocusent-neck-reading-light-blue]\n[Product: Cricut Joy 2 (Essentials bundle) | https://www.amazon.com/Cricut-Essential-Bundle-Digital-Content/dp/B0GJFS6L4M/?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FCricut-Joy-2-Essential-Bundle%2F19505908026, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fcricut-joy-2-cutting-machine-essential-bundle-blue%2F-%2FA-94898648%23lnk%3Dsametab]\n[Product: SwitchBot Smart Candle Warmer | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FPR5GCP9?th=1&tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Hoto 3.6V Electric Screwdriver Kit Pro | https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0BLMQ8BXB/ref=ewc_pr_img_1?smid=A2ZXT6R0FR7K6V&psc=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FHOTO-Electric-Screwdriver-Kit-25-Piece-Upgraded-Bit-Set-3-6V-Cordless-Screwdriver-Rechargeable%2F14102211010]\n[Product: Bonsai Tree Light | https://www.amazon.com/Aesthetic-Decorations-Weddings-Christmas-Holidays/dp/B08Q7DCKB6?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: PDP Riffmaster | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CWS8WKS5?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CWN15TRF?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FTZV2JHG?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Lego Star Wars Imperial Star Destroyer | https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Destroyer-Buildable-Anniversary-Minifigure/dp/B0CRWRY5RM?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Amazon Echo Spot | https://www.amazon.com/All-new-Amazon-Echo-Spot-2024-release-Smart-alarm-clock-with-vibrant-sound-Alexa-Black/dp/B0BFC7WQ6R?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: 8BitDo Retro 18 Mechanical Numpad | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PN9S6JU/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fsite%2F8bitdo-retro-mechanical-keypad-c64-edition%2F6593616.p, https://shop.8bitdo.com/products/8bitdo-retro-18-mechanical-numpad]\n[Product: Nothing Ear (a) | https://www.amazon.com/Nothing-Ear-Integration-Cancelling-Equaliser/dp/B0CXPR5412?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/Nothing-Ear-Integration-Cancelling-Equaliser/dp/B0CXPRP216/?th=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/Nothing-Ear-Integration-Cancelling-Equaliser/dp/B0CXPRHTNB/?th=1&tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Philips Hue Essential strip light (16 feet) | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0G3CWMTT6?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.philips-hue.com%2Fen-us%2Fp%2Flight-strip-hue-essential-strip-light-16-ft%2F046677608453]\n[Product: Govee Table Lamp Class