      "id": "techcrunch-2026-06-26-why-everyone-from-openai-to-spacex-is-building-their-own-chi",
      "title": "Why everyone from OpenAI to SpaceX is building their own chips (and turning up the heat on Nvidia)",
      "summary": "Nvidia has dominated the AI chip market for years, but the era of total dependence might be ending.   OpenAI just shared its plans to spice things up with Jalapeño, its custom inference chip built with Broadcom, joining Google, Apple, and SpaceX in a growing list of companies building their way out of single-supplier risk. The goal is less of a […]",
      "body": "Nvidia has dominated the AI chip market for years, but the era of total dependence might be ending.\nOpenAI just shared its plans to spice things up with Jalapeño, its custom inference chip built with Broadcom, joining Google, Apple, and SpaceX in a growing list of companies building their way out of single-supplier risk. The goal is less of a clean break and more of a hedge. Custom silicon means more control, hardware tuned to specific needs, and the kind of performance gains Apple unlocked when it ditched Intel.\nOn this episode of TechCrunch’s Equity podcast, hosts Kirsten Korosec, Anthony Ha, and Sean O’Kane dig into what the custom chip trend means for the industry and a few deals of the week worth watching.\nSubscribe to Equity on YouTube, Apple Podcasts, Overcast, Spotify and all the casts. You also can follow Equity on X and Threads, at @EquityPod.\na24, agility, AI, AI, AI chips, AI loops, Anthropic, custom silicon, Equity Video, groq, humanoid robots, nvidia, OpenAI, SPAC\nTheresa Loconsolo is an audio producer at TechCrunch focusing on Equity, the network’s flagship podcast. Before joining TechCrunch in 2022, she was one of 2 producers at a four-station conglomerate where she wrote, recorded, voiced and edited content, and engineered live performances and interviews from guests like lovelytheband. Theresa is based in New Jersey and holds a bachelors degree in Communication from Monmouth University. You can contact or verify outreach from Theresa by emailing theresa.loconsolo@techcrunch.com.\nSubscribe for the industry’s biggest tech news",
      "source": "TechCrunch",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
      "author": "Theresa Loconsolo",
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T17:43:22.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/GettyImages-2219673294.jpg?resize=1200,750",
      "originalUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/video/why-everyone-from-openai-to-spacex-is-building-their-own-chips-and-turning-up-the-heat-on-nvidia/",
