      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/06/260622_Slate_Press_Kit_03-600x400-bf06395.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.732984293194,100,78.534031413613",
