://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0FMS9FNVR?tag=theverge02-20, https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=nOD/rLJHOac&mid=13923&murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fproduct%2Fflowering-cactus-11509, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Flego-botanicals-flowering-cactus-building-toy-for-kids-valentine-39-s-day-gift-11509%2F-%2FA-94756761]\n[Product: Glocusent LED Neck Reading Light | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WNRN9WQ/?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FGlocusent-LED-Neck-Reading-Light-Book-Light-Bed-3-Colors-6-Brightness-Levels-Bendable-Arms-Rechargeable-Long-Lasting-Perfect-Reading-Knitting-Camping%2F18192324907, https://glocusent.com/products/glocusent-led-neck-light-amazon-best-seller-green]\n[Product: JLab Pop Party speaker | https://www.amazon.com/JLab-Party-Portable-Bluetooth-Speaker/dp/B0F39HFT56?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FPop-Party-Speaker-Black%2F15414251149, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fjlab-pop-party-speaker-black%2FJ3GW8XZWJT%2Fsku%2F6642353]\n[Product: Amazon Smart Plug | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089DR29T6/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Ring Indoor Cam (second-gen) | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6GLQJMV/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Logitech Pop Mouse | https://www.amazon.com/Logitech-Portable-Bluetooth-Programmable-Easy-Switch/dp/B0DB5CDRHV/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Flogitech-pop-mouse-bluetooth-optical-ambidextrous-mouse-with-customizable-emojis-wireless-daydream-purple-mint%2FJ7H7ZY8J83%2Fsku%2F6481445]\n[Product: Echo Pop | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CB9PF1N6?tag=theverge02-20]\nUpdate, June 23rd: Added new deals, including discounts for Amazon’s Echo Pop Kids and Blink Video Doorbell.",
