      "id": "theverge-2026-06-23-these-are-the-best-smart-home-deals-this-prime-day",
      "title": "These are the best smart home deals this Prime Day",
      "summary": "Smart locks and smart doorbells are on sale for Prime Day. | Photo by Jennifer Pattison Tuohy / The Verge\t\n\nEvery Prime Day is a good day to make your home smarter, as deals on connected gear proliferate not just on Amazon but all across the web. And this Prime Day is no different. I sifted through hundreds of offers to find the ones that actually stand out — only the deepest discounts on the best",
      "body": "Every Prime Day is a good day to make your home smarter, as deals on connected gear proliferate not just on Amazon but all across the web. And this Prime Day is no different. I sifted through hundreds of offers to find the ones that actually stand out — only the deepest discounts on the best products made the cut. Whether you need faster Wi-Fi, a better video doorbell, a more capable smart lock, or a robot vacuum that can keep up with your floors, these are the gadgets I recommend grabbing while prices are low.\n* The foundation of a good smart home is Wi-Fi, so if you’re still rocking a router with Wi-Fi 6 or even 5, Prime Day is a good time to upgrade. All of Amazon’s eero mesh Wifi routers are on sale, and its flagship eero Pro 7 is down to $549.99 from $699.99. If you don’t need that much power, the equally capable eero Pro 6E is down to $329 for a three-pack.\n[Product: Google Nest Wifi Pro | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCQSYPZB?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Ecobee Smart Doorbell Camera | http://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C424CVZ8?tag=theverge02-20, https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=nOD/rLJHOac&mid=46044&murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ecobee.com%2Fen-us%2Fsmart-doorbell-camera-wired%2F]\n* Ring’s newest doorbell cameras are 50 percent off for Prime Day. The Ring Wired 2K is $39.99, and the Ring Battery 2K is $49.99. These aren’t top-of-the-line; that’s the Pro 4K model (which is on sale for 28 percent off, down to $179.99). But 2K video still works with Ring’s AI-powered features, which give you a clearer picture of what’s happening around your home. These require a Ring subscription plan, as does viewing any recorded video.\n* The newest Google Nest video doorbell, the Wired 2K, is down to $138.99 from $179.99 and, unlike Ring models, comes with free 10-second clips. Google also has new Gemini AI-powered features for sifting through your footage, which are part of its Google Home Premium subscription.\n[Product: Level Lock Pro | http://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FKLKV3MV?tag=theverge02-20, https://levelhome.sjv.io/c/482924/2851592/33079?u=https%3A%2F%2Flevel.co%2Fproducts%2Flevel-lock%2Fpro%2F]\n[Product: Aqara Smart Lock U400 | https://www.amazon.com/Aqara-Fingerprint-Touchscreen-Rechargeable-Assistant/dp/B0FRS6T6HL/?tag=theverge02-20, https://us.aqara.com/products/smart-lock-u400]\n* The rubbed bronze version of the versatile Yale Assure Lock 2 with Wi-Fi is $70 off on Prime Day. This lock features a real keypad, not a touchscreen, along with support for all the major smart home platforms, including Apple Home (although it doesn’t work with Home Key).\nGood deals on smart appliances\n[Product: Narwal Flow 2 | https://www.amazon.com/NARWAL-Self-Cleaning-Recognition-Self-Emptying-Tangle-Free/dp/B0GFW4J291?th=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://narwalus.pxf.io/c/482924/2788060/31973?u=https%3A%2F%2Fus.narwal.com%2Fproducts%2Fnarwal-flow-2-robot-vacuum-and-mop]\n[Product: Dreame L40 Ultra | https://www.amazon.com/DREAME-Auto-Empty-Self-Cleaning-Detangling-Extending/dp/B0DYSWW2LN/?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: SwitchBot Standing Circulator Fan | https://www.amazon.com/SwitchBot-Pedestal-Rechargeable-Oscillating-Adjustable/dp/B0FWC41M2P/ref=sr_1_2?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.switch-bot.com%2Fproducts%2Fswitchbot-standing-circulator-fan]\n* SwitchBot’s Smart Candle Warmer is $10 off, down to $29.99 at Amazon. This is a delightful gadget and a solution to my firefighter husband’s fear of candles. You can set schedules to turn it on and off in the app or any connected smart home platform and have pleasant scents waft safely throughout your home on demand.\nSlashed prices on smart lighting\n[Product: Philips Hue Twilight sleep-wake lamp | https://www.amazon.com/Philips-Hue-Bluetooth-Compatible-Assistant/dp/B0DBXHCZFG?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.philips-hue.com%2Fen-us%2Fp%2Fsleep-and-wake-up-light-twilight-sleep-and-wake-up-light-black%2F046677585631%3Forigin%3D_cmp%3D20961164112_kwd%3D%26gclsrc%3Daw.ds%26gad_source%3D1%26gad_campaignid%3D20967583196%26gbraid%3D0AAAAAqwUBEQcnFUTeIcjO4TDNO6aIyhRu%26gclid%3DCj0KCQjw_rPGBhCbARIsABjq9cewKhIjvdj0Yuk2L3FQU3p5wulNDSM8QvGpKyMBhUxuBcEq1KgSIwYaAsVWEALw_wcB]\n* Govee’s colorful Smart Outdoor S14 Bulb String Lights 2 are 41 percent off at Amazon, down to $69.99. These Matter-compatible RGBICW smart lights are IP66-rated, work with every smart home platform, and integrate with the Govee app for fun lighting and sound effects.\n* For an elegant outdoor look, Philips Hue’s Festavia Permanent Outdoor String Lights are 50 percent off, down to $283 at Amazon for the 150-foot model. These fit to your home’s exterior for year-round color-changing lights.\n[Product: Philips Hue Play HDMI Sync Box 8K | https://www.amazon.com/Philips-Hue-Play-HDMI-sync/dp/B0DKRHBBZZ?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.philips-hue.com%2Fen-us%2Fp%2Fhue-philips-hue-play-hdmi-sync-box-8k%2F046677579753]\n* For $51 on Amazon, this is one of the lowest prices I’ve ever seen on a Philips Hue light strip. Part of its new Essentials line, the Essential 16ft LED Strip Light, RGBIC, can work with or without a Hue bridge and has all the same features as Hue’s higher-priced models.\n[Product: SwitchBot Bot | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B7NXV4R?tag=theverge02-20]",
